                        "string_id":  "enc_equipment_devic_hand_radio",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "Military walkie-talkie capable of receiving a wide range of radio bandwidths. Used by stalkers as an efficient method of instant communication, they are also convenient for intel gathering and intercepting of unencrypted transmissions.\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]PROPERTIES:\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,70,130,180]Utility\\n \\n\n\t\t",
                        "JA_current":  "Military walkie-talkie capable of receiving a wide range of radio bandwidths. Used by stalkers as an efficient method of instant communication, they are also convenient for intel gathering and intercepting of unencrypted transmissions.\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]PROPERTIES:\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,70,130,180]Utility\\n \\n\n\t\t",
                        "JA_new":  "軍用の携帯無線機。幅広い周波数帯を受信できる。ストーカーにとっては即時連絡の手段として便利なうえ、情報収集や暗号化されていない通信の傍受にも役立つ。\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]諸元：\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,70,130,180]ユーティリティ\\n \\n\n\t\t",
