                        "JA_current":  "An irreparably broken walkie-talkie. It is badly damaged and moisture seems to have gotten into the internals.\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]PROPERTIES:\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,70,130,180]Utility\\n \\n\n\t\t",
                        "JA_new":  "修復できないほど壊れた携帯無線機。ひどく損傷しており、内部に水分が入り込んだようだ。\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]諸元：\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,70,130,180]ユーティリティ\\n \\n\n\t\t",
