                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "A combination of chemicals synthesized for the treatment of the Chernobyl plague spread by infected zombies and rats.\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]PROPERTIES:\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,255,140,0]Quest Item\\n \\n\n\t\t",
                        "JA_current":  "A combination of chemicals synthesized for the treatment of the Chernobyl plague spread by infected zombies and rats.\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]PROPERTIES:\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,255,140,0]Quest Item\\n \\n\n\t\t",
                        "JA_new":  "感染したゾンビやネズミが広めるチェルノブイリの疫病を治療するために合成された、薬品の混合物。\\n \\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255]諸元：\\n\n\t\t%c[0,255,255,255] • %c[0,255,140,0]クエストアイテム\\n \\n\n\t\t",
