                        "source_xml_line":  529,
                        "string_id":  "st_roubles_descr",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "Trade in the Zone is conducted mainly by means of electronic transactions facilitated by PDAs for safety and ease of management. Despite that, many stalkers still keep at least a few coins in their pockets just in case.\n\t\t",
                        "JA_current":  "Trade in the Zone is conducted mainly by means of electronic transactions facilitated by PDAs for safety and ease of management. Despite that, many stalkers still keep at least a few coins in their pockets just in case.\n\t\t",
                        "JA_new":  "ゾーンでの取引は、安全性と管理のしやすさから、主にPDAを使った電子決済で行われる。それでも、万一に備えて小銭をいくらかポケットに入れているストーカーは多い。\n\t\t",
                        "review_notes":  null,
                        "english_reference_status":  "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
